{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/08/27/8588030/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/08/27/8588030/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏の全国ツアー、福岡・大坂公演に\nお越し下さった皆さま、有難うございました(﹡ˆˆ﹡)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/08/27/8588030/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/08/27/8588030/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/08/27/8588030/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左から、真夏、私、れいか ♭♭"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/08/27/8588030/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カメラ：まいまい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/08/27/8588030/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山汗かいたから、ライブ終わりは\nお風呂あがりみたいだよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/08/27/8588030/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまい、ゆったんと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地方公演は、これでもう全てが終了してしまいました( ´•_•。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いよいよ東京・神宮球場にて\n真夏の全国ツアー、ラストですっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地方の皆さん本当に有難うございました！\n乃木坂46は、結成4周年を迎え、5年目に突入しました。\n来年はもっともっと大きくなって戻ってきて、各地を回りたいと思います。(﹡ˆˆ﹡)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/08/27/8588030/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせ♭♭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現在発売中のヤングガンガンさんの\n浴衣美女図鑑に、載っています！\nチェックしてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/08/27/8588030/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/08/27/8588030/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/08/27/8588030/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/08/27/8588030/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浴衣と言えば...\nNOGIBINGO!5見てくださった方、有難うございました(﹡ˆ_ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は、あの浴衣、まいまいといくちゃんが選んでくれたやつなんです！\n小百合だから、百合のお花の柄を選んでくれて、かわいくって、\n嬉しかったです(#^^#)*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"胸キュンセリフ、、「いっぱい思い出つくってくれる？(/////)」\n恥ずかしかった..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ、握手会で猫じゃらししても、猫パンチはしませんよーっ (,,> <,,)笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと、今回のnogiroomにも出ているので、良かったら見てください ＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"打ち上げ花火って、近くで見れたらきれいなのかなあ...？\nいつか花火大会とか行ってみたいなあ。。。(´,,•ω•,,｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして次回、30日深夜のNOGIBINGO!5でも、浴衣を着ています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カラオケ大会楽しかったなっ＾＾♪\n私も、ある方の歌を歌わせて頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみに〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/08/27/8588030/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それからそれから、お知らせばかりで申し訳ないのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日！  28日放送のべマーズに、\n滝谷サユリというヤンキーのボス役で登場します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかる人はわかると思いますが、\n名前は、ク○ーズZERO のあれです（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"激しい乱闘シーンにも挑戦しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆのヤンキーなんて想像できないなぁ〜。      ...って思った方！ ！\nぜひ見てください(﹡ˆˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お芝居の幅がまた少し広がったのではないかなぁと思います。\nとても勉強になりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだ、ひめたんが 「はい、天使。」と言って写真を送ってきたので\n何だろって見てみたら..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/08/27/8588030/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイクしようと思って鏡の前まで\n来たとこで、寝たっぽい。\nお恥ずかしい:(´◦ω◦｀):"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/08/27/8588030/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/08/27/8588030/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/08/27/8588030/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/08/27/8588030/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}